cc-io-skp (crates/io-skp) is a port of CadCraft's own SketchUp reader cc-skp (lib/skp, Apache-2.0). cc-skp's format
knowledge comes from OpenSKP (https://github.com/iamahsanmehmood/openskp, MIT, Copyright (c) 2024-2026 Ahsan Mehmood),
read as a map by the cc-skp authors; no OpenSKP code is copied or shipped. See crates/io-skp/NOTICE for the MIT text.

