  licence (the full notice is in crates/manifold/src/disjoint.rs; this is an altered version).
- the vector and matrix operations of Manifold's linalg.h, based on linalg.h 2.2 by Sterling Orsten (public domain).

cc-m3d (crates/m3d/src/jsmath.rs) carries a copy of the same fdlibm 5.3 sin/cos kernels (notice above).

